WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:01.967
SIMU LIU
One of the best things about the MCU

00:00:02.017 --> 00:00:03.459
is getting to see your
favorite characters team up.

00:00:03.509 --> 00:00:05.443
AWKWAFINA
Totally! Like Ant-Man and the Wasp,

00:00:05.493 --> 00:00:08.232
or Iron Man and War Machine,
or Rocket and Groot!

00:00:08.282 --> 00:00:11.095
Today we're going
to play a rapid-fire game...

00:00:12.427 --> 00:00:16.074
...featuring Marvel's
newest superhero, Shang-Chi. You ready?

00:00:16.124 --> 00:00:17.158
SIMU LIU
Let's go!

00:00:17.208 --> 00:00:19.242
AWKWAFINA
Aliens are invading New York.

00:00:19.293 --> 00:00:20.564
SIMU LIU
I'm gonna go with Captain Marvel.

00:00:20.614 --> 00:00:21.838
AWKWAFINA
Who does he grab a slice with?

00:00:21.888 --> 00:00:23.049
SIMU LIU
Uh, Tony Stark!

00:00:23.099 --> 00:00:25.099
AWKWAFINA
Busting up an enemy bunker together with?

00:00:25.149 --> 00:00:25.935
SIMU LIU
Hulk.

00:00:25.985 --> 00:00:27.708
AWKWAFINA
Karaoke night! Who's he harmonizing with?

00:00:27.758 --> 00:00:28.169
SIMU LIU
You!

00:00:28.219 --> 00:00:30.911
KATY and SHANG-CHI
[Singing] Over, sideways, and under...

00:00:30.961 --> 00:00:31.755
AWKWAFINA
Going up against Thanos!

00:00:31.805 --> 00:00:32.677
Who would he want
to be next to him?

00:00:32.727 --> 00:00:33.286
SIMU LIU
Iron Man.

00:00:33.336 --> 00:00:34.396
AWKWAFINA
You're running late to a friend's party,

00:00:34.446 --> 00:00:35.911
who would you call to give
you a lift to get there on time?

00:00:35.961 --> 00:00:36.317
SIMU LIU
You.

00:00:36.367 --> 00:00:37.302
KATY
We make a good team.

00:00:37.352 --> 00:00:38.138
AWKWAFINA
Alright, last one!

00:00:38.188 --> 00:00:41.596
Joy-riding through
San Francisco in a sweet new ride...

00:00:41.646 --> 00:00:42.198
KATY
I'm driving!

00:00:42.248 --> 00:00:43.377
AWKWAFINA
...you borrowed from someone

00:00:43.427 --> 00:00:44.370
way nicer than you?

00:00:44.420 --> 00:00:45.596
SIMU LIU
Uh, borrowed?

00:00:45.646 --> 00:00:47.037
KATY
Get in. I'll go slow.

00:00:47.552 --> 00:00:48.883
SHANG-CHI
Right! Go right!

00:00:51.828 --> 00:00:53.544
AWKWAFINA
Don't miss the MCU's newest hero

00:00:53.594 --> 00:00:54.860
and his BFF Katy...

